[Script Info]Title: Default Aegisub fileScriptType: v4.00+WrapStyle: 0ScaledBorderAndShadow: yesYCbCr Matrix: TV.709PlayResX: 1920PlayResY: 1080[V4+ Styles]Format: Name, Fontname, Fontsize, PrimaryColour, SecondaryColour, OutlineColour, BackColour, Bold, Italic, Underline, StrikeOut, ScaleX, ScaleY, Spacing, Angle, BorderStyle, Outline, Shadow, Alignment, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, EncodingStyle: Main-207+,Impress BT,83,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.75,3.75,2,180,180,27,1Style: Flashbacks-720p,Impress BT,83,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00525252,&H78000000,0,-1,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,4.125,3.75,2,180,180,27,1Style: Thoughts-207+,Impress BT,83,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00525252,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,4.125,3.75,2,180,180,27,1Style: Secondary-207+,Impress BT,83,&H00D6D6D6,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.75,3.75,2,180,180,27,1Style: Title,Agency FB,95,&H00FEFEFE,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,120,100,0.75,0,1,2.7,0,2,15,15,360,1Style: Captions,Impress BT,56,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2.7,0,2,15,15,30,1Style: Credits-207+,FOT-Greco Std DB Strp,60,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,1.5,0,1,3.8,0,7,15,15,15,1Style: Lyrics-OP5,FOT-Greco Std DB Strp,57,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00060606,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,1,0,1,4,0,2,33,33,27,1Style: Karaoke-OP5,Duality,90,&H000090FF,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,15,15,15,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextDialogue: 5,0:01:51.63,0:01:54.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nooo!Dialogue: 5,0:01:54.97,0:01:57.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm falling! I'm falling!Dialogue: 5,0:01:57.93,0:02:00.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm falling!Dialogue: 5,0:02:13.11,0:02:14.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right! We've landed!Dialogue: 5,0:02:14.91,0:02:17.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boy, I'm exhausted.Dialogue: 5,0:02:18.87,0:02:21.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't "We've landed" me! I thought I'd die!Dialogue: 5,0:02:21.75,0:02:23.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What else could we have done?!Dialogue: 5,0:02:23.62,0:02:27.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're the one who said we couldn't use the elevator or else they would find us!Dialogue: 5,0:02:27.92,0:02:30.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That doesn't mean you had to jump off!Dialogue: 5,0:02:30.21,0:02:32.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're not that square-nosed shipwright!Dialogue: 5,0:02:32.67,0:02:35.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I... I'm sorry.Dialogue: 5,0:02:35.30,0:02:38.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, fine. At least it got us down.Dialogue: 5,0:02:38.18,0:02:39.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If it's okay, don't hit me!Dialogue: 5,0:02:43.10,0:02:46.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We may be in some trouble.Dialogue: 5,0:02:46.69,0:02:49.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Trouble? What trouble?Dialogue: 5,0:02:49.90,0:02:52.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This island's topography and climate.Dialogue: 5,0:02:52.57,0:02:55.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With this much wind blowing,  if the atmospheric pressure drops,Dialogue: 5,0:02:55.91,0:02:58.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,a typhoon might come through tonight.Dialogue: 5,0:02:58.70,0:03:01.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This town is called the City of Water.Dialogue: 5,0:03:01.16,0:03:04.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In other words, it's prone to suffering flood damage.Dialogue: 5,0:03:04.58,0:03:06.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So? What about it?Dialogue: 5,0:03:06.67,0:03:10.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, it bothers me a little,  so I'll look into it later.Dialogue: 5,0:03:10.75,0:03:13.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, let's get back to the inn.Dialogue: 5,0:03:16.30,0:03:21.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Following the Aqua Laguna warning  issued for the entire island,Dialogue: 5,0:03:21.97,0:03:24.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,all the shipbuilding factories  and docks on Shipyard IslandDialogue: 5,0:03:24.89,0:03:27.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,will be opened as evacuation centers.Dialogue: 5,0:03:27.94,0:03:32.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We expect large crowds, so please evacuate as soon as possible.Dialogue: 5,0:03:33.32,0:03:38.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Additionally, since Dock One  is currently in a dangerous state...Dialogue: 5,0:03:38.07,0:03:40.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll put the iron plate on.Dialogue: 5,0:03:42.41,0:03:44.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have everything you need?Dialogue: 5,0:03:44.04,0:03:47.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, we do. Let's evacuate to the shipyard.Dialogue: 5,0:03:47.42,0:03:50.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, hold on a bit.  I'd better fill the gap good with rope.Dialogue: 5,0:03:51.67,0:03:54.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If our house gets flooded,  everything will be ruined.Dialogue: 5,0:03:54.96,0:04:00.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, the wind is starting to get strong!  Get ready for waves soon!Dialogue: 5,0:04:00.51,0:04:04.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guys! If we take our time,  assassin pirates will show up too!Dialogue: 5,0:04:04.72,0:04:05.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's scary!Dialogue: 5,0:04:05.77,0:04:07.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where did he disappear to?!Dialogue: 5,0:04:07.27,0:04:09.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure he came this way.Dialogue: 5,0:04:09.06,0:04:10.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He should still be around!Dialogue: 5,0:04:10.94,0:04:12.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, you guys go look over there.Dialogue: 5,0:04:12.77,0:04:14.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Got it!Dialogue: 5,0:04:20.62,0:04:22.78,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?Dialogue: 5,0:04:22.78,0:04:25.95,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Why're they chasing me? I don't get it!Dialogue: 5,0:04:35.25,0:04:36.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So this is the reason!Dialogue: 5,0:04:37.63,0:04:40.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're a crew of assassins?Dialogue: 5,0:04:40.05,0:04:43.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a pain. Now I can't even go back to the inn.Dialogue: 5,0:04:43.22,0:04:45.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah... Who's over there?!Dialogue: 5,0:04:45.77,0:04:47.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Over here! I found someone suspicious!Dialogue: 5,0:04:49.73,0:04:51.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you sure, innkeeper?Dialogue: 5,0:04:51.02,0:04:55.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes. Those pirates have been staying  at my inn since last night.Dialogue: 5,0:04:55.65,0:04:57.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They were here until just a bit ago.Dialogue: 5,0:04:57.40,0:04:58.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They were here?!Dialogue: 5,0:04:58.95,0:05:02.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes. Since they've still got  a lot of luggage in their room,Dialogue: 5,0:05:02.49,0:05:05.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they might come back.Dialogue: 5,0:05:06.08,0:05:08.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, then! You guys, stay here.Dialogue: 5,0:05:08.91,0:05:11.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The rest of you,  let's go look around here together!Dialogue: 5,0:05:11.37,0:05:14.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen, make sure you leave  no stone unturned to find them!Dialogue: 5,0:05:14.42,0:05:15.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right!Dialogue: 5,0:05:26.56,0:05:28.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, there's no one here!Dialogue: 5,0:05:30.23,0:05:32.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is this really their ship?Dialogue: 5,0:05:32.56,0:05:35.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no mistake about it! Look!Dialogue: 5,0:05:35.15,0:05:37.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the Straw Hats' pirate flag.Dialogue: 5,0:05:37.28,0:05:40.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I bet they've already abandoned it.Dialogue: 5,0:05:40.86,0:05:42.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This ship is all beat up.Dialogue: 5,0:05:46.83,0:05:48.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So? Did you find them?Dialogue: 5,0:05:48.49,0:05:49.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, they aren't here!Dialogue: 5,0:05:49.70,0:05:53.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There isn't much left inside the ship.  This ship is definitely abandoned.Dialogue: 5,0:05:53.96,0:05:55.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go look someplace else.Dialogue: 5,0:06:07.60,0:06:10.31,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Who were they?Dialogue: 5,0:06:13.39,0:06:17.15,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Is something happening in town?Dialogue: 5,0:06:17.15,0:06:18.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you find them?Dialogue: 5,0:06:18.08,0:06:19.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No.Dialogue: 5,0:06:19.61,0:06:21.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit! Where are they?!Dialogue: 5,0:06:26.99,0:06:29.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy.Dialogue: 5,0:06:29.20,0:06:30.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm? What is it, Nami?Dialogue: 5,0:06:30.83,0:06:32.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you think everyone's okay?Dialogue: 5,0:06:32.71,0:06:35.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Craftsmen are everywhere in town.Dialogue: 5,0:06:35.04,0:06:40.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think Chopper and Sanji-kun should be okay  since their faces are still unknown.Dialogue: 5,0:06:40.09,0:06:41.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Either way, let's hurry!Dialogue: 5,0:06:41.17,0:06:42.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 5,0:06:46.39,0:06:49.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The sea train is still in service.Dialogue: 5,0:06:49.35,0:06:52.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like the afternoon train has already left,Dialogue: 5,0:06:52.02,0:06:55.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but it looks like a night departure is still scheduled in this bad weather?Dialogue: 5,0:06:55.65,0:07:01.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bound for Enies Lobby at 11 tonight. The sea train is pretty impressive.Dialogue: 5,0:07:01.07,0:07:03.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Any information on the pirates?!Dialogue: 5,0:07:03.07,0:07:05.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No. We've got nothing.Dialogue: 5,0:07:05.03,0:07:09.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we can just capture one and squeeze 'em,  they'll spill the beans on the rest.Dialogue: 5,0:07:09.66,0:07:12.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry up! Before the waves get too high!Dialogue: 5,0:07:13.16,0:07:16.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Robin got on the sea train.Dialogue: 5,0:07:16.58,0:07:20.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If she did, things can't get any worse.Dialogue: 5,0:07:20.88,0:07:24.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Water Seven is already  too big to handle.Dialogue: 5,0:07:24.55,0:07:28.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder if I did something  to upset her at the bookstore.Dialogue: 5,0:07:28.09,0:07:30.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You dummy. There's no way that's the case.Dialogue: 5,0:07:30.60,0:07:31.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey you.Dialogue: 5,0:07:31.97,0:07:33.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have you seen a pretty woman like her?Dialogue: 5,0:07:33.93,0:07:37.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, that... you mean the pretty woman that  looked like that 20 years ago?Dialogue: 5,0:07:37.31,0:07:41.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I had, I would've immediately told  the paper company or Galley-La.Dialogue: 5,0:07:41.36,0:07:45.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But to think she's an assassin...  What a surprise, eh?Dialogue: 5,0:07:45.78,0:07:50.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, it's fine if you wanna look for the culprits,  but you should evacuate soon.Dialogue: 5,0:07:50.16,0:07:52.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or you'll be swallowed by Aqua Laguna.Dialogue: 5,0:07:53.49,0:07:55.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See ya.Dialogue: 5,0:08:00.75,0:08:02.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Things are going wrong for all of us.Dialogue: 5,0:08:02.84,0:08:05.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Luffy and the others are okay.Dialogue: 5,0:08:05.42,0:08:09.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy's fine. The one I'm worried  about is Nami-san.Dialogue: 5,0:08:11.43,0:08:14.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The town is becoming quite empty.Dialogue: 5,0:08:15.52,0:08:20.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The wind is gradually getting stronger, too.  People have started evacuating.Dialogue: 5,0:08:21.52,0:08:23.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit.Dialogue: 5,0:08:23.40,0:08:27.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Robin-chan ! Where'd you go?!Dialogue: 5,0:08:29.45,0:08:32.45,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,This scent... could it be?Dialogue: 5,0:08:34.87,0:08:36.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper, what's up?!Dialogue: 5,0:08:37.04,0:08:38.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper?!Dialogue: 5,0:08:40.00,0:08:42.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Wait!Dialogue: 5,0:08:44.21,0:08:45.13,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,She's here.Dialogue: 5,0:08:47.05,0:08:49.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper! Chopper!Dialogue: 5,0:08:50.51,0:08:53.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Oops!Dialogue: 5,0:08:56.31,0:08:57.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, are you okay?!Dialogue: 5,0:08:59.14,0:09:00.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper! Are you okay?!Dialogue: 5,0:09:01.44,0:09:02.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you hurt?Dialogue: 5,0:09:02.56,0:09:06.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon, don't be so reckless!  What the hell is going on?Dialogue: 5,0:09:06.48,0:09:10.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Starting to run so... suddenly...Dialogue: 5,0:09:13.03,0:09:14.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Robin!  – Robin-chan !Dialogue: 5,0:09:16.37,0:09:19.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where have you been?!  We looked all over for you!Dialogue: 5,0:09:19.33,0:09:23.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone's worried about you!  Now, let's go back to the inn.Dialogue: 5,0:09:23.08,0:09:26.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, a lot happened  while you were gone. I'll explain in detail.Dialogue: 5,0:09:26.71,0:09:29.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But this distance is annoying.Dialogue: 5,0:09:29.34,0:09:32.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold on! I'll be right over there!Dialogue: 5,0:09:33.55,0:09:36.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, that's okay. Stay there.Dialogue: 5,0:09:37.01,0:09:38.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 5,0:09:38.60,0:09:39.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't be...Dialogue: 5,0:09:39.77,0:09:43.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,returning to the crew.Dialogue: 5,0:09:43.94,0:09:47.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're parting ways here... in this town.Dialogue: 5,0:09:47.98,0:09:51.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-What're you saying, Robin-chan ?Dialogue: 5,0:09:51.65,0:09:53.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it. It's about the newspaper, right?Dialogue: 5,0:09:53.78,0:09:55.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about that!Dialogue: 5,0:09:56.41,0:09:58.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,None of us believe it.Dialogue: 5,0:09:58.79,0:10:02.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pirates are falsely accused all the time!Dialogue: 5,0:10:02.41,0:10:03.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah...Dialogue: 5,0:10:03.42,0:10:07.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for framing you all for a crime you didn't commit.Dialogue: 5,0:10:07.96,0:10:12.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But the article is telling the truth.Dialogue: 5,0:10:12.01,0:10:16.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I really was the one who infiltrated  the mayor's residence last night.Dialogue: 5,0:10:16.55,0:10:17.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 5,0:10:18.14,0:10:19.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No!Dialogue: 5,0:10:19.47,0:10:23.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I carry a darkness within me  that you all don't know about.Dialogue: 5,0:10:24.10,0:10:27.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This darkness will destroy you someday.Dialogue: 5,0:10:29.28,0:10:32.95,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,To date, every organization that brought in Nico RobinDialogue: 5,0:10:32.95,0:10:37.62,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,has been wiped out. She's the only survivor.Dialogue: 5,0:10:38.62,0:10:44.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact, I'm pinning this  crime on you and planning to run away.Dialogue: 5,0:10:44.33,0:10:46.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The situation will only get worse.Dialogue: 5,0:10:46.58,0:10:49.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?! Why are you–Dialogue: 5,0:10:49.00,0:10:53.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why I'm doing it?  You don't need to know.Dialogue: 5,0:10:55.22,0:10:59.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin-chan ! I don't get what you're saying!  What happened to you?!Dialogue: 5,0:10:59.56,0:11:02.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin! Let's go back together!Dialogue: 5,0:11:04.35,0:11:08.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I only spent a short time with you,  but after today,Dialogue: 5,0:11:08.90,0:11:11.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll never see you again.Dialogue: 5,0:11:12.61,0:11:16.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you for being so kind to someone like me.Dialogue: 5,0:11:18.32,0:11:19.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Farewell.Dialogue: 5,0:11:33.88,0:11:35.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait...Dialogue: 5,0:11:36.05,0:11:38.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey... wait...Dialogue: 5,0:11:39.64,0:11:41.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't...Dialogue: 5,0:11:41.51,0:11:43.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,accept this.Dialogue: 5,0:11:44.77,0:11:45.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey...Dialogue: 5,0:11:47.56,0:11:49.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait!Dialogue: 5,0:11:51.94,0:11:54.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop joking!Dialogue: 5,0:11:54.11,0:11:55.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait! Robin-chan !Dialogue: 5,0:11:55.95,0:11:56.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin-chan !Dialogue: 5,0:11:57.70,0:12:00.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait! Robin-chan ! Robin-chan !Dialogue: 5,0:12:08.37,0:12:11.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin!Dialogue: 5,0:12:18.05,0:12:19.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I lost sight of her.Dialogue: 5,0:12:19.55,0:12:20.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 5,0:12:23.89,0:12:26.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Chopper...  – Hm?Dialogue: 5,0:12:26.06,0:12:31.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go join Luffy and the others  and tell them everything that just happened.Dialogue: 5,0:12:31.06,0:12:34.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't leave out a single word.Dialogue: 5,0:12:34.28,0:12:35.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What're you gonna do?Dialogue: 5,0:12:35.31,0:12:38.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll part ways here for a bit.Dialogue: 5,0:12:39.11,0:12:42.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, don't worry.  I won't do anything reckless.Dialogue: 5,0:12:43.95,0:12:44.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where'd they go?Dialogue: 5,0:12:44.95,0:12:46.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look in every nook and cranny!Dialogue: 5,0:12:46.50,0:12:48.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What about the alleys?!Dialogue: 5,0:12:48.50,0:12:50.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Could they have  climbed up on a rooftop?!Dialogue: 5,0:12:51.25,0:12:52.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit! We lost 'em!Dialogue: 5,0:12:53.34,0:12:55.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But they definitely ran in this direction!Dialogue: 5,0:12:55.55,0:12:57.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Should we check over there?!Dialogue: 5,0:12:57.42,0:12:59.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then we'll search inside the buildings!Dialogue: 5,0:12:59.63,0:13:02.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right! Let's split up and move out!Dialogue: 5,0:13:02.18,0:13:03.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 5,0:13:05.72,0:13:06.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is it okay now?Dialogue: 5,0:13:07.02,0:13:08.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not yet.Dialogue: 5,0:13:10.06,0:13:11.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where did you lose them?!Dialogue: 5,0:13:14.36,0:13:16.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A bit longer.Dialogue: 5,0:13:33.33,0:13:34.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah...Dialogue: 5,0:13:39.47,0:13:40.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please...Dialogue: 5,0:13:41.55,0:13:45.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come back another time!  I'm evacuating now. Stop pestering me!Dialogue: 5,0:13:46.31,0:13:49.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please... I've got money.Dialogue: 5,0:13:50.02,0:13:54.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As much lumber, tar, and rope as this will buy...Dialogue: 5,0:13:54.81,0:13:58.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Also, some nails, latches, and tinplates.Dialogue: 5,0:13:58.32,0:14:00.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm closing the shop.Dialogue: 5,0:14:00.53,0:14:02.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah... I'm sorry, but...Dialogue: 5,0:14:08.67,0:14:10.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, then.Dialogue: 5,0:14:10.29,0:14:12.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But this ain't enough for all that.Dialogue: 5,0:14:12.75,0:14:17.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Th-Then, to make up for the rest,  I'd like to exchange my tools.Dialogue: 5,0:14:17.46,0:14:19.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, don't be ridiculous! Stop it!Dialogue: 5,0:14:19.71,0:14:24.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I only sell. You can't barter here. What are you, some kind of bumpkin?Dialogue: 5,0:14:28.35,0:14:30.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll be a yagara's saddle.Dialogue: 5,0:14:38.44,0:14:42.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-Hey! Should you be carrying  all that stuff with such an injury?Dialogue: 5,0:14:42.86,0:14:45.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Surely you have friends to help, right?! Hey!Dialogue: 5,0:14:47.53,0:14:49.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See, what did I tell you?Dialogue: 5,0:15:06.64,0:15:08.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on a sec, lad!Dialogue: 5,0:15:10.60,0:15:12.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm okay. This is nothing.Dialogue: 5,0:15:12.35,0:15:12.98,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 5,0:15:12.98,0:15:15.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is it? Are you gonna help–Dialogue: 5,0:15:15.60,0:15:16.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No.Dialogue: 5,0:15:16.85,0:15:20.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here. Take these. You're hungry, right?Dialogue: 5,0:15:25.45,0:15:26.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you.Dialogue: 5,0:15:26.45,0:15:29.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sure.  Be careful out there.Dialogue: 5,0:15:36.12,0:15:37.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Be careful out there!Dialogue: 5,0:15:48.68,0:15:50.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,These're good.Dialogue: 5,0:15:50.22,0:15:53.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,These're really good.Dialogue: 5,0:15:53.18,0:15:56.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a considerate man he was.Dialogue: 5,0:16:08.91,0:16:11.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The waves are getting pretty high.Dialogue: 5,0:16:17.83,0:16:20.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. It'll be okay.Dialogue: 5,0:16:28.93,0:16:33.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're a... ship that flew!Dialogue: 5,0:16:34.68,0:16:36.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry!Dialogue: 5,0:16:47.69,0:16:49.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's got your bikini in a twist?Dialogue: 5,0:16:58.08,0:17:00.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Franky?Dialogue: 5,0:17:07.71,0:17:08.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bro?Dialogue: 5,0:17:10.43,0:17:12.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm getting ticked off!Dialogue: 5,0:17:12.05,0:17:14.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's about time  to go on another rampage!Dialogue: 5,0:17:15.60,0:17:18.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bro! Wait for us!Dialogue: 5,0:17:19.39,0:17:22.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the drink, Blueno!Dialogue: 5,0:17:26.32,0:17:29.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened to Franky all  of a sudden, Kokoro-san ?Dialogue: 5,0:17:33.32,0:17:40.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beats me. There's just no telling how idiots think.Dialogue: 5,0:17:52.76,0:17:54.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's finally calmed down.Dialogue: 5,0:17:54.60,0:17:56.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Finally calmed down"?!Dialogue: 5,0:17:56.35,0:17:59.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You had all those shipwrights chasing after you!Dialogue: 5,0:17:59.52,0:18:02.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're the one that dragged us into it, too!Dialogue: 5,0:18:02.23,0:18:05.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I said it was unavoidable, didn't I?Dialogue: 5,0:18:05.77,0:18:09.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you figured out where we were, Chopper.Dialogue: 5,0:18:09.69,0:18:10.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your scent.Dialogue: 5,0:18:10.56,0:18:12.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.Dialogue: 5,0:18:12.49,0:18:15.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh? Come to think of it, where's Sanji?Dialogue: 5,0:18:15.20,0:18:16.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well...Dialogue: 5,0:18:30.83,0:18:33.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did Robin really say that?!Dialogue: 5,0:18:34.84,0:18:35.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 5,0:18:42.64,0:18:45.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All of us knew something had to happen, right?Dialogue: 5,0:18:47.86,0:18:52.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if it was for a short time, Robin was an enemy before she came aboard.Dialogue: 5,0:18:53.07,0:18:57.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If she suddenly got scared and ran away, it wouldn't sit right with me.Dialogue: 5,0:18:59.03,0:19:02.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isn't it about time  for us to settle the matter?Dialogue: 5,0:19:03.66,0:19:07.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that woman friend or foe?Dialogue: 5,0:19:10.42,0:19:17.18,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,The situation will only get worse.  After today, I'll never see you again.Dialogue: 5,0:19:20.89,0:19:24.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're sure Robin said that, Chopper?Dialogue: 5,0:19:26.19,0:19:26.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 5,0:19:28.36,0:19:31.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She said she wouldn't see us after today.Dialogue: 5,0:19:31.82,0:19:35.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It also sounds like she's  planning to do somethingDialogue: 5,0:19:35.07,0:19:37.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that could worsen the situation.Dialogue: 5,0:19:41.95,0:19:43.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look at how big a fussDialogue: 5,0:19:43.75,0:19:46.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the mayor's attempted assassination stirred up.Dialogue: 5,0:19:46.87,0:19:49.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If it's possible to make the situation worse,Dialogue: 5,0:19:49.92,0:19:52.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,there's only one thing she can do.Dialogue: 5,0:19:52.71,0:19:55.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Assassinate the mayor for sure this time.Dialogue: 5,0:19:58.47,0:20:00.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the natural conclusion.Dialogue: 5,0:20:02.76,0:20:06.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But we know she intends  to pin the crime on us,Dialogue: 5,0:20:06.98,0:20:11.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so it's possible that it's a trap  to lure us to the scene of the crime.Dialogue: 5,0:20:11.36,0:20:12.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A trap?Dialogue: 5,0:20:12.86,0:20:16.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we're at the assassination tonight,Dialogue: 5,0:20:16.49,0:20:18.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the blame will fall to us.Dialogue: 5,0:20:18.99,0:20:23.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! You make it sound like  Robin really is our enemy!Dialogue: 5,0:20:24.24,0:20:26.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm talking about the possibility.Dialogue: 5,0:20:26.66,0:20:28.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not that I've decided either way.Dialogue: 5,0:20:29.79,0:20:33.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I were to decide now to believe her or not,Dialogue: 5,0:20:33.59,0:20:35.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and the truth turned out to be the opposite,Dialogue: 5,0:20:37.26,0:20:40.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it'd slow down my reaction.Dialogue: 5,0:20:45.14,0:20:48.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If something's going to happen,  it'll be tonight. Are we going?Dialogue: 5,0:20:48.89,0:20:50.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We are.Dialogue: 5,0:20:51.19,0:20:56.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't mind going, but there's a problem.Dialogue: 5,0:20:56.23,0:21:00.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji-kun saw Robin walking  with someone, right?Dialogue: 5,0:21:00.78,0:21:03.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceburg-san said the same thing.Dialogue: 5,0:21:03.49,0:21:06.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She was with someone wearing a mask.Dialogue: 5,0:21:06.50,0:21:09.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But it wasn't any of us.Dialogue: 5,0:21:10.21,0:21:13.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He must be the reason  why Robin suddenly changed.Dialogue: 5,0:21:13.63,0:21:17.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isn't he making Robin do bad things?!Dialogue: 5,0:21:17.59,0:21:19.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That would be the best case.Dialogue: 5,0:21:19.93,0:21:23.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The worst case would be if this guy is really Robin's friend.Dialogue: 5,0:21:24.10,0:21:29.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But "someone wearing a mask"  can't be a clue. That's the problem.Dialogue: 5,0:21:29.52,0:21:31.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's our goal?Dialogue: 5,0:21:31.35,0:21:33.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll capture Robin.Dialogue: 5,0:21:34.82,0:21:37.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, we won't have a clue.Dialogue: 5,0:21:38.90,0:21:42.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,True. Thinking about it is a waste of time.Dialogue: 5,0:21:42.16,0:21:43.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it,Dialogue: 5,0:21:43.16,0:21:48.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the World Government has been trying  to capture that woman for 20 years,Dialogue: 5,0:21:48.04,0:21:50.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and yet, they've failed at every turn.Dialogue: 5,0:21:51.25,0:21:53.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But if we wanna know the truth,  this is the only way.Dialogue: 5,0:21:56.13,0:21:58.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll do my best too!Dialogue: 5,0:21:58.38,0:22:00.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well then, let's go...Dialogue: 5,0:22:00.26,0:22:02.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to Galley-La Company!Dialogue: 5,0:22:07.93,0:22:11.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit!  It's getting dark.Dialogue: 5,0:22:11.94,0:22:16.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Paulie-san ! This's enough!  The backstreets will soon be too dangerous to search.Dialogue: 5,0:22:17.27,0:22:19.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Let's go back.Dialogue: 5,0:22:19.69,0:22:20.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm going to the office.Dialogue: 5,0:22:20.82,0:22:22.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 5,0:22:22.53,0:22:25.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys! We're going back!Dialogue: 5,0:22:25.91,0:22:30.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat! Show yourself!Dialogue: 5,0:22:30.58,0:22:33.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where're you hiding?!Dialogue: 5,0:22:33.67,0:22:37.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat! That bastard!Dialogue: 5,0:22:37.46,0:22:40.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought the guy had at least a bit of mettle.Dialogue: 5,0:22:41.72,0:22:44.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But he doesn't even show himself.Dialogue: 5,0:22:44.13,0:22:47.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But Bro, the entire island is out for their heads.Dialogue: 5,0:22:48.47,0:22:51.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's right. I bet they're scurrying around like rats.Dialogue: 5,0:22:52.89,0:22:56.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By the way, what's the matter?  What're you guys doing?Dialogue: 5,0:22:56.06,0:23:00.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're vulnerable  to strong winds from the front.Dialogue: 5,0:23:01.48,0:23:05.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,More importantly, Bro, the way you're  raging today is different from usual.Dialogue: 5,0:23:05.57,0:23:09.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Letting stuff build up inside isn't like you.Dialogue: 5,0:23:09.16,0:23:13.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up! It's just that kind of week!Dialogue: 5,0:23:13.20,0:23:15.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bro!Dialogue: 5,0:23:13.20,0:23:15.33,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 5,0:23:15.33,0:23:17.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Bro! Bro!  – It's Zambai and the others.Dialogue: 5,0:23:19.21,0:23:22.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bro! Did you beat up those bastards?Dialogue: 5,0:23:22.76,0:23:24.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, not yet.Dialogue: 5,0:23:24.13,0:23:26.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There was some crazy interference.  They got away.Dialogue: 5,0:23:26.93,0:23:27.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 5,0:23:27.97,0:23:30.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They got away from you  when you were angry?!Dialogue: 5,0:23:30.68,0:23:33.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How lucky they must be!Dialogue: 5,0:23:33.22,0:23:39.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see. Since that weak long-nosed guy  was fixing their ship all by himself,Dialogue: 5,0:23:39.61,0:23:43.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just assumed that you beat up the others.Dialogue: 5,0:23:43.03,0:23:45.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? You found one of them?!Dialogue: 5,0:23:45.49,0:23:47.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, on their ship.Dialogue: 5,0:23:51.83,0:23:54.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you've found one of them,  that makes it easy.Dialogue: 5,0:23:54.91,0:23:59.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can use him to make 'em reveal themselves!Dialogue: 5,0:23:59.79,0:24:02.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,B-Bro's got his bad-guy face on.Dialogue: 5,0:24:04.46,0:24:08.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well then, you guys!  I want you to start marching through town,Dialogue: 5,0:24:09.47,0:24:11.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,shouting, "We've got the long-nose!Dialogue: 5,0:24:11.51,0:24:13.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To keep him from sleepin' with the fishes,Dialogue: 5,0:24:13.35,0:24:15.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,come to the warehouse under the bridge!Dialogue: 5,0:24:15.89,0:24:19.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky sends his regards!"Dialogue: 5,0:24:21.73,0:24:26.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go kidnap that long-nose  and make it the truth.Dialogue: 5,0:24:26.65,0:24:30.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, Bro! Leave it to us!Dialogue: 5,0:24:48.51,0:24:52.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aqua Laguna is coming!Dialogue: 5,0:24:52.60,0:24:56.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're Aqua Laguna!Dialogue: 5,0:24:56.68,0:24:59.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So what's going on with those assassins?Dialogue: 5,0:24:59.52,0:25:02.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I heard that they haven't been caught yet.Dialogue: 5,0:25:02.11,0:25:06.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How disturbing. Ahh, what a pain.Dialogue: 5,0:25:06.15,0:25:10.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I heard they might attack again tonight  in the confusion of the storm.Dialogue: 5,0:25:10.53,0:25:13.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aqua Laguna is here!Dialogue: 5,0:25:13.70,0:25:15.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But it'll be crazy tonight.Dialogue: 5,0:25:15.83,0:25:20.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I heard all the craftsmen  will be guarding the main office.Dialogue: 5,0:25:20.04,0:25:22.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! That's pretty serious!Dialogue: 5,0:25:22.50,0:25:26.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How many are there in the Straw Hat Pirates?Dialogue: 5,0:25:26.50,0:25:31.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Some people said 50. Others said 100.Dialogue: 5,0:25:31.09,0:25:33.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The captain's got a 100-million bounty after all.Dialogue: 5,0:25:33.80,0:25:38.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Some said that 3,000 of his men would advance from the sea!Dialogue: 5,0:25:38.14,0:25:40.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That sounds totally dangerous!Dialogue: 5,0:25:46.57,0:25:50.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Galley-La Company!  Form a line, and don't leave any openings!Dialogue: 5,0:25:50.61,0:25:52.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 5,0:25:52.61,0:25:55.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't allow even a single rat inside!Dialogue: 5,0:25:55.24,0:25:57.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 5,0:26:13.43,0:26:15.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bring it on!Dialogue: 5,0:26:16.97,0:26:21.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up!  Be quiet, Tilestone!Dialogue: 5,0:26:22.06,0:26:24.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was told they weren't on the sea train.Dialogue: 5,0:26:25.40,0:26:28.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then they're still somewhere  on the island, huh?Dialogue: 5,0:26:28.98,0:26:32.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But they're fools if they really appear  with all these guards around.Dialogue: 5,0:26:33.36,0:26:37.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I heard that an idiot plunged in here  in the middle of the day today.Dialogue: 5,0:26:38.54,0:26:40.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Common sense doesn't apply to them.Dialogue: 5,0:26:41.45,0:26:43.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Um,Dialogue: 5,0:26:43.83,0:26:46.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they don't have to go this far.Dialogue: 5,0:26:46.58,0:26:48.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're doing it voluntarily.Dialogue: 5,0:26:49.55,0:26:50.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's like I'm a king.Dialogue: 5,0:26:51.38,0:26:55.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By the way, why did you put up  Nico Robin's wanted poster in your room?Dialogue: 5,0:26:56.80,0:26:57.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Does it bother you?Dialogue: 5,0:27:00.39,0:27:00.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A little.Dialogue: 5,0:27:05.44,0:27:07.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's better if you don't know.Dialogue: 5,0:27:10.94,0:27:13.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She is... a devil.Dialogue: 5,0:27:40.93,0:27:43.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tons of people are guarding the entrance.Dialogue: 5,0:27:43.47,0:27:45.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a little far.Dialogue: 5,0:27:45.35,0:27:47.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can't you just stretch your arm and fly in?Dialogue: 5,0:27:47.52,0:27:49.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After the commotion starts, got it?Dialogue: 5,0:27:49.36,0:27:55.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. If we start the commotion,  they'll just take advantage of it.Dialogue: 5,0:27:55.07,0:27:56.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen up!Dialogue: 5,0:27:56.95,0:27:59.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't miss even the slightest movement!Dialogue: 5,0:27:59.66,0:28:04.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.17,0:01:53.22,Title,,0,0,0,,DevilDialogue: 1,0:01:50.17,0:01:53.22,Title,,0,0,0,,DevilDialogue: 0,0:04:48.73,0:04:55.32,Captions,,0,0,0,,InnkeeperDialogue: 1,0:04:48.73,0:04:55.32,Captions,,0,0,0,,InnkeeperDialogue: 0,0:24:44.59,0:24:48.51,Captions,,0,0,0,,Shipyard Basement Storeroom (Evacuation Center)Dialogue: 1,0:24:44.59,0:24:48.51,Captions,,0,0,0,,Shipyard Basement Storeroom (Evacuation Center)Dialogue: 2,0:24:44.59,0:24:48.51,Captions,,0,0,0,,Shipyard Basement Storeroom (Evacuation Center)Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.71,0:26:12.59,Captions,,0,0,0,,Outside Iceburg's BedroomDialogue: 1,0:26:06.71,0:26:12.59,Captions,,0,0,0,,Outside Iceburg's BedroomDialogue: 2,0:26:06.71,0:26:12.59,Captions,,0,0,0,,Outside Iceburg's BedroomDialogue: 0,0:26:43.08,0:26:48.92,Captions,,0,0,0,,BedroomDialogue: 1,0:26:43.08,0:26:48.92,Captions,,0,0,0,,BedroomDialogue: 2,0:26:43.08,0:26:48.92,Captions,,0,0,0,,BedroomDialogue: 0,0:00:26.26,0:00:31.82,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 1,0:00:26.26,0:00:31.82,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 2,0:00:26.26,0:00:31.82,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 0,0:00:26.26,0:00:31.82,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Galaxy 9000Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.26,0:00:31.82,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Galaxy 9000Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.53,0:00:36.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,GraphicsDialogue: 1,0:00:32.53,0:00:36.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,GraphicsDialogue: 2,0:00:32.53,0:00:36.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,GraphicsDialogue: 0,0:00:32.53,0:00:36.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,DatenshiDialogue: 1,0:00:32.53,0:00:36.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,DatenshiDialogue: 0,0:00:37.10,0:00:40.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,KaraokeDialogue: 1,0:00:37.10,0:00:40.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,KaraokeDialogue: 2,0:00: